{"seq":1,"slug":"merge-evaluation","title":"合并评估：怎样知道合并真的成功了","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/practice/merge-evaluation","wordCount":2022,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"合并评估-怎样知道合并真的成功了\">合并评估：怎样知道合并真的成功了</h1><p>模型合并有一个格外危险的性质：它几乎总能产出一个「能跑」的模型，输出看起来通顺，甚至在某个榜单上分数还涨了。于是很多人以为合并成功了——直到上线才发现它在没被测到的能力上悄悄退化，或者所谓的提升只是过拟合了那个榜单。合并的评估比普通微调更容易骗人，因为你同时改变了多种能力，任何单一指标都只照亮了模型的一个侧面。这一篇讲怎样系统评估一个合并模型，避免「看着涨、实则偏」的假象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>合并评估的第一原则是：<strong>永远对照单模型</strong>。合并几乎总能产出一个「能跑」的模型，因此任何单一指标都会骗人——判别成败不看绝对分数，而看合并模型是否在每个维度都不劣于对应的源模型。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mtext>acc</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>merge</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mtext>acc</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(\\lambda) = \\frac{1}{|T|}\\sum_{t \\in T} \\frac{\\text{acc}_t(\\theta_{\\text{merge}}(\\lambda))}{\\text{acc}_t(\\theta_t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7487em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">merge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>目标函数</strong>：用各源模型自身分数做归一化的「相对保留率」，比绝对分数更公平——不会因某任务本来就难而惩罚合并。</li>\n<li><strong>三条特有陷阱</strong>：只测被合并任务而漏测通用能力衰退、继承源模型的基准污染造成刷榜错觉、格式与对齐漂移（纯准确率指标看不出来）。</li>\n<li><strong>评估矩阵</strong>：各被合并任务 + 通用能力基线 + 对照每个源模型 + 格式/对齐抽检 + 留出集复测 + 稳健性，须全绿而非单点飘红。</li>\n<li><strong>数据隔离纪律</strong>：参与过合并（Fisher/RegMean 统计量、MoE 正向提示、系数搜索验证集）的数据不得再用于评估——「免训练」的假象下这条最容易被忽视。</li>\n<li><strong>成本控制</strong>：两级结构——搜索阶段用几百条的代理评估集快筛，只对少数入围配方跑完整评估终验。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"合并评估的三条特有陷阱\">合并评估的三条特有陷阱</h2><p>先认清合并特有的坑，它们和普通模型评估不同。</p>\n<p>第一坑是<strong>只测被合并任务，漏测通用能力衰退</strong>。你合并了代码模型和数学模型，自然会去测代码和数学——都涨了，皆大欢喜。但合并很可能悄悄削弱了通用对话、指令遵循、常识问答这些「没人专门测」的能力。必须把通用基线（如 MMLU、通用指令集）纳入评估，确认合并没有以通用能力为代价换取专项提升。</p>\n<p>第二坑是<strong>基准污染与刷榜错觉</strong>。社区里大量「高分」合并模型，其高分部分来自被合并成员本身在评测集上的污染（训练数据里混入了测试题）。合并会把这种污染继承甚至放大。看到某个开源合并模型榜单登顶，要警惕它是真强还是继承了污染，尽量用未公开或自建的留出集复测。</p>\n<p>第三坑是<strong>格式与对齐漂移</strong>。合并两个用不同对话模板、不同对齐策略训练的模型，产出模型可能出现输出格式错乱、拒答行为异常、system prompt 失效等问题，而这些在纯准确率指标里完全看不出来。需要单独做格式一致性与对齐行为的人工抽检。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一套最小可用的评估矩阵\">一套最小可用的评估矩阵</h2><p>针对上述陷阱，一个合并模型至少要在下面这张矩阵上取得全绿，而不是单点飘红。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>测什么</th>\n<th>防的陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>各被合并任务</td>\n<td>每个源模型的专项基准</td>\n<td>合并是否保住了目标能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通用能力基线</td>\n<td>MMLU / 通用指令遵循 / 常识</td>\n<td>通用能力有没有被换掉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对照单模型</td>\n<td>每个源模型在所有维度的分数</td>\n<td>合并到底比单模型好在哪、坏在哪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式与对齐</td>\n<td>输出格式、拒答、模板一致性</td>\n<td>对齐/格式漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>留出/私有集</td>\n<td>未公开数据上的复测</td>\n<td>基准污染与刷榜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳健性</td>\n<td>分布外、对抗性输入</td>\n<td>是否只在测试分布上好看</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心原则是<strong>永远对照单模型</strong>。合并的意义是「比任何单个源模型都更全面」，所以评估表里必须并排列出每个源模型在每个维度的成绩。如果合并模型在任务 A 上还不如原始 A 模型、在任务 B 上也不如原始 B 模型，那这次合并就是失败的——哪怕它的「平均分」看着不难看。这种「样样通、样样松」是合并干扰的典型表征，处理它要回到 <a href=\"interference-mitigation\">干扰缓解</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估驱动的合并系数搜索\">评估驱动的合并系数搜索</h2><p>评估不只是事后验收，它还是合并调参的目标函数。回忆 <a href=\"../methods/task-arithmetic\">任务向量算术</a> 里的缩放系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 与各方法的密度/丢弃率，这些超参没有解析最优，只能靠评估来选。标准做法是把「多任务综合表现」定义成一个标量目标，再搜索超参：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mtext>acc</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>merge</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mtext>acc</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(\\lambda) = \\frac{1}{|T|}\\sum_{t \\in T} \\frac{\\text{acc}_t(\\theta_{\\text{merge}}(\\lambda))}{\\text{acc}_t(\\theta_t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7487em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">merge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母用各源模型自身分数做归一化，衡量「合并保留了源模型多少比例的能力」，取各任务平均。这个相对保留率比绝对分数更公平——它不会因为某任务本来就难而惩罚合并。搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 就是最大化这个 score，具体的网格/进化搜索方法在 <a href=\"interference-mitigation\">干扰缓解</a> 展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[候选合并配方&lt;br/&gt;方法+系数] --&gt; B[生成合并模型]&#10;    B --&gt; C[各被合并任务基准]&#10;    B --&gt; D[通用能力基线]&#10;    B --&gt; E[对照各源模型]&#10;    B --&gt; F[格式/对齐抽检]&#10;    C --&gt; G[计算相对保留率 score]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{全维度不劣于&lt;br/&gt;源模型?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[调系数/换方法&lt;br/&gt;回到搜索]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[通过, 进入部署评估]&#10;    I --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[候选合并配方&lt;br/&gt;方法+系数] --&gt; B[生成合并模型]\n    B --&gt; C[各被合并任务基准]\n    B --&gt; D[通用能力基线]\n    B --&gt; E[对照各源模型]\n    B --&gt; F[格式/对齐抽检]\n    C --&gt; G[计算相对保留率 score]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{全维度不劣于&lt;br/&gt;源模型?}\n    H --&gt;|否| I[调系数/换方法&lt;br/&gt;回到搜索]\n    H --&gt;|是| J[通过, 进入部署评估]\n    I --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"别用合并里的数据来评估合并\">别用合并里的数据来评估合并</h2><p>一个隐蔽但致命的方法论错误：如果你用 Fisher/RegMean（<a href=\"../advanced/fisher-regmean\">Fisher 与 RegMean</a>）收集统计量、或用 mergekit-moe 的正向提示初始化路由器时用到了某批数据，那这批数据就<strong>不能</strong>再拿来评估，否则就是拿训练材料测自己，分数虚高。合并虽然「免训练」，但只要某个环节看过数据（统计量、提示、系数搜索的验证集），那部分数据就被「用掉」了，评估必须用独立的留出集。这与普通机器学习的训练/验证/测试分离是同一个纪律，只是在「免训练」的假象下更容易被忽视。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估成本与自动化\">评估成本与自动化</h2><p>全面评估很贵——每换一组超参就要在整个矩阵上跑一遍。工程上分两级：搜索阶段用一个小而快的<strong>代理评估集</strong>（每任务几百条）做超参筛选，只对少数入围配方跑<strong>完整评估</strong>做最终验收。同时把评估流水线固化成脚本，保证每个合并模型走完全相同的矩阵、可复现、可横向对比。这套「代理集快筛 + 完整集终验」的两级结构，是把评估成本压到可承受范围的关键，也和蒸馏模型的评估纪律相通（见 <a href=\"../../llm-distillation/practice/distillation-evaluation\">LLM 蒸馏 · 蒸馏评估</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合并评估特别容易骗人：模型总能跑通，但可能通用能力退化、继承基准污染、或出现格式/对齐漂移。</li>\n<li>最小评估矩阵要覆盖各被合并任务、通用基线、格式对齐、留出集、稳健性，且永远并排对照每个源模型。</li>\n<li>判定成败的核心是相对保留率：合并模型应在每个维度不劣于对应源模型，「样样松」即失败。</li>\n<li>评估也是合并调参的目标函数，用相对保留率驱动系数搜索。</li>\n<li>参与过合并（统计量/提示/系数搜索）的数据不得再用于评估；工程上用「代理集快筛+完整集终验」控成本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>评估暴露干扰后如何处理：<a href=\"interference-mitigation\">干扰缓解</a></li>\n<li>被评估的超参从哪来：<a href=\"../methods/task-arithmetic\">任务向量算术</a></li>\n<li>用数据做统计量的方法需注意评估隔离：<a href=\"../advanced/fisher-regmean\">Fisher 与 RegMean</a></li>\n<li>跨库延伸——相似的评估纪律：<a href=\"../../llm-distillation/practice/distillation-evaluation\">LLM 蒸馏 · 蒸馏评估</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合并评估：怎样知道合并真的成功了","id":"合并评估-怎样知道合并真的成功了"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"合并评估的三条特有陷阱","id":"合并评估的三条特有陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"一套最小可用的评估矩阵","id":"一套最小可用的评估矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"评估驱动的合并系数搜索","id":"评估驱动的合并系数搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"别用合并里的数据来评估合并","id":"别用合并里的数据来评估合并"},{"level":2,"text":"评估成本与自动化","id":"评估成本与自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"MoE 化合并：把几个稠密专才拼成一个混合专家","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/advanced/moe-upcycling"},"next":{"title":"干扰缓解：合出来打架了，工程上怎么调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/practice/interference-mitigation"}}